{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/538862-thinking-with-portals","id":538862,"title":"Thinking with Portals","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-03T15:57:11-07:00","id":538862,"title":"Thinking with Portals","content":"So, I have a few questions I'd like some opinions on related to gates into the hedge.<br /> <br /> 1.Suppose a Changeling, let's call him Wanderbunk, decides to open a gate into the hedge and then stand in the portal so that h's half in the real world and half in the hedge. What happens when the gate normally closes? Is he split in half? Does he &quot;wedge&quot; it open until he moves into one realm or the other? Is he &quot;pushed&quot; into one realm or the other?<br /> <br /> 2. Two children are playing a game. Let's call them Bob and Sarah. Sarah is sitting in a closet. Bob is standing outside the closet looking in at Sarah. Suddenly Wanderbunk crashes in through a window, perhaps running from a True Fae. He spends a glamour and opens a portal into the hedge using the closet entrance for the gate. As per the rules, Bob is now looking into the hedge rather than a closet with Sarah in it. But what does Sarah, being &quot;behind&quot; the gateway, see as she looks out into what had previously been a room with Bob in it?<br /> <br /> 3. Still on the above example. The gate has not yet closed. Sarah gets bored with being in the closet, and decides to try and exit. What happens to the gate? What happens to Sarah?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T17:00:50-07:00","id":538946,"title":"","content":"1. Offhand, since it closes X turns after the last person goes through, my knee jerk would be to say it is open till he moves through then the countdown starts.<br /> <br /> 2+3. I would have her see Bob, and have no effect until she walks out and sees the portal behind her.<br /> <br /> Those would be my off the cuff in game calls anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"h